abstract: >
  Finite exact spectral core on (Z/30Z)^x ≅ C2 × C4 with
  closed finite Fourier formula, Parseval identity, canonical geometric
  scale lambda = 1/sqrt(7), and exact coercive gap kappa = 2 on the
  explicit coercive sector H° ∩ altVec⊥. No proof of RH is claimed.
